---
const words = [
  ['Icons', 'mail', 'wink', ''],
  ['that', 'heart', 'nod', ''],
  // en el teléfono baja de línea y su mascota taparía la de arriba
  ['peek.', 'check', 'flip', 'max-sm:[&>.pk]:hidden'],
];
---
<section id="top" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-24 pb-20 sm:pt-32">
  <h1 class="text-[clamp(56px,10vw,128px)] leading-[0.92] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.045em] [--pk-inset:0.08em] [--pk-size:0.42em] sm:whitespace-nowrap">
    {words.map(([w, icon, g, extra]) => (
      <><span class:list={['inline-block', extra]} data-peekon={icon} data-peekon-gesture={g}>{w}</span>{' '}</>
    ))}
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Little characters that come out from behind your buttons, make a gesture and hide again. They
    say hello when they first scroll into view. 27 icons, about 2 KB of motion, for React, Astro or
    plain HTML.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <button data-copy="npm i peekons" data-peekon="download" data-peekon-gesture="nod" class="group inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-fg pr-2 pl-5 font-mono text-sm text-bg">
      npm i peekons
      <span class="rounded-full bg-bg/15 px-3 py-1 font-sans text-xs" data-copy-label>Copy</span>
    </button>
    <a href="#playground" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-line px-5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-surface">Open the playground</a>
  </div>
</section>
